  "summaryOfChange": "Re‑formulated the core question to focus on a possible day‑18 systematic factor because the combined evidence (negative drift in pendulum_obs, positive drift in resonator_lab, and a statistically significant cross‑correlation between pendulum_lab and resonator_obs) points to an anomaly not captured by the previous hypotheses. Added a hypothesis for a data‑logging error (H3) to account for opposite‑sign shifts and updated probabilities, raising the environmental factor hypothesis (H2) and lowering the random‑fluctuation hypothesis (H1). The residual probability was kept small to reflect the possibility of an unconsidered cause."
