      "probability": 0.25,
      "rationale": "If resonator_obs values are smoothed or batch‑imported using a three‑day window, the resulting series could be forced to track the pendulum_lab data shifted by three days. This would generate a perfect linear relationship without altering raw measurements of the other instruments.",
      "evidenceFor": ["cross_corr_pl_ro_3d_offset"],
